<section class="meaning-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What does "Tayo Na" mean?</h2>
    <p>
      <em>Tayo na</em> is a Filipino phrase meaning <strong>"let's go"</strong
      > — or more warmly,
      <strong>"let's go together."</strong> It's the spirit of travel with the people
      you love, and that's exactly what this app is about.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

